<h3>About Computer Systems Security</h3>

<p>Computer Systems Security provides guidance on the ways to prevent, identify, unserstand,and recover from attacks against computer systems. The course consists of a fully developed, downloadable textbook with text, lab activities, and review questions, broken into ten chapters.</p>

